.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.venv
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
__pycache__
*.pyc
# Nested interpreter caches and Finder metadata. Patterns without **/ match
# only at the context root. codingcanary.LoadPublicPack ignores exactly these
# names, so a stray cache never reaches or disables the certification pack.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
**/target
context-docs
wandb
